This repository is not open source. No licence is granted except as stated
below.

1. SCOPE

   This licence covers everything in this repository that the Owner or its
   contributors created, including:

   (a) source code, scripts and tests;
   (b) configuration, infrastructure and deployment files;
   (c) documentation, specifications and decision records; and
   (d) derived data: datasets, aggregates, models, maps and other outputs
       produced by this software, to the extent that they are not governed by
       a third-party data licence (see section 4).

2. PERMITTED USE

   Use, copying and modification are permitted only:

   (a) by the Owner; and
   (b) by people and AI agents the Owner has authorised to work on this
       project, solely for the purpose of developing, testing and operating it
       for the Owner.

3. RESTRICTIONS

   Unless the Owner gives prior written permission, no one may:

   (a) distribute, publish, sublicense, sell or otherwise make available any
       part of the repository or its derived data to any third party;
   (b) use any part of it for any purpose other than the one in section 2(b);
       or
   (c) remove or alter this notice or any third-party attribution.

4. THIRD-PARTY DATA

   Data obtained from third parties remains subject to its own licence, which
   takes precedence over this one for that data and anything derived from it.
   The sources and their licences are listed in docs/data_sources.md.
   Current sources include:

   (a) Licence Ouverte / Open Licence 2.0 (Etalab), for open data from the
       French national access point: reuse requires attribution of the source
       and the date of the last update; and
   (b) the Bison Futé reuse licence for real-time traffic information
       ("action b", version 9), for restricted-access data: reuse requires
       the attribution "Information provided by [producer]", display of the
       last-update time to end users, no alteration or misrepresentation of
       the content, and that any third party receiving the data accepts the
       same conditions.

   Nothing in this licence restricts rights that a third-party licence grants
   to others, and the Owner grants no rights in third-party data beyond those
   that licence allows.

5. THIRD-PARTY SOFTWARE

   Third-party libraries, tools and container images used by this project
   remain under their own licences.

6. NO WARRANTY

   The repository and its derived data are provided "as is", without warranty
   of any kind. The Owner is not liable for any damage arising from their use.

7. REVIEW

   This licence reflects the decision to keep the project internal until the
   end of Phase 3 (DECISIONS.md, D3). It will be reviewed at that point.
